---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Mechveck"
	description="Deep research reports powered by frontier AI"
	pubDate={new Date('January 11 2026')}
>
	<p>
		<strong>Mechveck</strong> produces deep research reports using frontier AI models
		like Claude and GPT-4. We're transparent about our process: AI does the heavy
		lifting, humans provide direction and quality control.
	</p>

	<h2>How It Works</h2>
	<p>
		Each report starts with a research question. We use AI deep research capabilities
		to gather information from across the web, then synthesize findings into
		comprehensive reports with full citations.
	</p>
	<p>Our sources include:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>User reviews</strong> — G2, Capterra, TrustRadius, Reddit</li>
		<li><strong>Official documentation</strong> — Pricing pages, feature lists, changelogs</li>
		<li><strong>Industry analysis</strong> — Published reports, case studies, expert commentary</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Why Transparency Matters</h2>
	<p>
		Too many sites claim "we tested" products they've never touched. We take a
		different approach: honest attribution. You'll know exactly where information
		comes from and how it was gathered.
	</p>
	<p>
		AI research tools have gotten remarkably capable. Rather than pretend otherwise,
		we lean into it — producing reports that would take humans weeks in a fraction
		of the time, while maintaining rigorous citation standards.
	</p>

	<h2>What We Cover</h2>
	<p>
		Anything worth researching. Current focus areas include software tools,
		productivity systems, and emerging technology — but the methodology works
		for any topic where good information is scattered across the web.
	</p>

	<h2>Get in Touch</h2>
	<p>
		Find us on <a href="https://github.com/mechveck">GitHub</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>
